3. Authorized Theatre exception

The Authorized Theatre may use, copy, install, build, operate, maintain and modify
the Software for its own activities, including performances with paid admission.
Its employees and technical specialists or contractors acting on its behalf
may do the same solely for that theatre's activities. They may receive payment
for their work and supply source code, builds and backups to the theatre and
its authorized technical specialists. The theatre may retain copies and engage
replacement technical specialists without losing this permission.

This exception does not permit selling or licensing the Software as a commercial
product, providing it as a paid service to other venues, or extending commercial
permission to other theatres or customers. A contractor may not rely on this
exception for unrelated clients. Those activities require separate written
permission from the relevant copyright holder.

